    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## (Optional) Step 3 — Enrich `catalog` with epos and inventory data (joined by SKU)\n",
    "\n",
    "The shared `catalog` table contains planogram and category metadata per SKU. The cell below materialises a local enriched copy in `main.gold.catalog`, joining your internal data warehouse on `sku_name` to add:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Sales figures** — units sold (13-week and 52-week rolling), gross revenue, average selling price\n",
    "- **Cost and margin data** — unit production cost, gross margin %, supplier lead time, reorder point\n",
    "\n",
    "Replace `your_catalog.*` with your actual catalog and schema names."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "76f3c736-fffe-448a-93a1-8e896ef79c83",
