    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## (Optional) Step 4 — Enrich `subsection` with store demographic data (joined by outlet)\n",
    "\n",
    "The shared `subsection` table links shelf subsections to outlets. The cell below joins Nielsen Homescan catchment data and your store CRM on `outlet_name` + `outlet_address` to add:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Store attributes** — format (superstore / convenience / express), retail banner, region, floor area\n",
    "- **Nielsen Homescan demographics** — catchment population, median household income, age bands, shopper mission index, weekly footfall, category spend index\n",
    "\n",
    "Replace `your_catalog.*` with your actual catalog and schema names."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "5abf86ef-090c-47f7-a90c-48f24ef56ace",
